   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- The fourth track in the performance setlist is identified as Prowl Great Cain [3]\n- The eighth track in the performance setlist is identified as Commandante [3]\n- The fifteenth track in the performance setlist is identified as Palmcorder Yajna [3]\n- The twentieth track in the performance setlist is identified as Hast Thou Considered The Tetrapod [3]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **MTN GOATS01**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [6]\n- **MTN GOATS02**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [6]\n- **MTN GOATS03**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [6]\n- **MTN GOATS04**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [6]\n- **MTN GOATS05**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [6]\n- **MTN GOATS06**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [6]\n- **MTN GOATS07**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [6]\n- **MTN GOATS08**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [6]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **TMG2012-01-31.aud.flac16** (recommended): audience recording; 22 songs; 74 min; rated 4.5/5 by 4 [1]. Said about its sound: The audio file exhibits some waveform clipping, though the overall quality is considered awesome [3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The uploader noted this was their first time seeing the band perform live [4]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **TMG2012-01-31.aud.flac16**: taped by R. Shuler; transferred by R. Shuler; source: Oktava 012's > Sound Devise MP2> Tascam DAP1 [1]",
